  "description": "Raw spice is the desert's great argument. It offers the colony a path to medicine, trade, and acceleration, but it is never gathered in safety or abundance for long.\n\nThat gives melange its proper tone in the mod. It is not just another harvestable stack. It is a reason to take risks that sensible survivors might otherwise avoid.",
