  "sections": {
    "economy": {
      "body": "Because one successful harvest can materially change a colony's options, melange gives the survival game bursts of momentum. It lets the player buy room to breathe without making the desert forgiving."
    },
    "handling": {
      "body": "The item stays intentionally mundane in presentation: a bag of powder, carried and stored like cargo. That contrast helps the value feel earned rather than magical."
    },
    "overview": {
      "body": "Raw spice is wealth before refinement. It carries the glamour of Arrakis, but on the ground it is still a dirty field resource clawed out of a hostile landscape."
    }
  },
